        "biography": "",
        "appearance": "",
        "notes": "<h5>Tactics</h5><p>In combat, a <strong>detective</strong> uses their Spot the Weakness action to hamper an opponent before striking with either their Knife or Snub Nose Pistol. Spot the Weakness can also help a detective get out of danger in a pinch, while the Prone or Slowed side effects of their Dueling Cane or Knife actions can buy some breathing room. Detectives avoid fighting to the death when possible, preferring to live to sleuth another day.</p>",
        "role": "rival"
    },
