                "id": "spot-the-weakness",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The [[lookup @actor.name]]{Actor Name} makes an [[test skill=ins]] against the Physical defense of a target they can sense within 60 feet of them. On a success, the target’s deflect value becomes 0 until the end of their next turn, the [[lookup @actor.name]]{Actor Name}’s next Strike against the target deals an extra [[/r 2d6]] damage, and the [[lookup @actor.name]]{Actor Name} can <strong>Disengage</strong> as <span class=\"cosmere-icon\">0</span>.</p>",
                    "chat": "",
